sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as RHOAI Dashboard
    participant KFPAPI as KFP API Server
    participant InitC as Init Container<br/>(odh-pipelines-components)
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3/MinIO<br/>443/9000 TCP
    participant Trainer as Kubeflow Trainer<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant EvalHub as Eval Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OGX as OGX API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Milvus as Milvus<br/>19530/TCP gRPC
    participant Ray as Ray/CodeFlare<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over InitC,KFPAPI: Flow 1: Managed Pipeline Staging (Init)
    InitC->>InitC: Compile Python pipeline.py → KFP YAML
    InitC->>KFPAPI: Write YAML to /config/managed-pipelines (shared volume)
    KFPAPI->>KFPAPI: Load managed pipeline YAMLs at startup

    Note over User,ModelReg: Flow 2: Fine-Tuning Pipeline (LoRA/OSFT/SFT)
    User->>Dashboard: Select managed fine-tuning pipeline
    Dashboard->>KFPAPI: Submit pipeline run
    KFPAPI->>HF: GET model/dataset<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
    KFPAPI->>S3: GET training data<br/>Auth: AWS IAM creds
    Note right of KFPAPI: dataset_download component
    KFPAPI->>Trainer: POST TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: SA Token (mTLS)
    Note right of Trainer: LoRA(Unsloth) / OSFT(mini-trainer) / SFT(instructlab)
    Trainer-->>KFPAPI: Training complete (checkpoints on PVC)
    KFPAPI->>KServe: POST InferenceService CR<br/>Auth: SA Token
    Note right of KServe: vLLM serving (8080/TCP)
    KFPAPI->>EvalHub: POST evaluation job<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    EvalHub-->>KFPAPI: Benchmark scores
    KFPAPI->>ModelReg: POST model version<br/>Auth: None (insecure HTTP)

    Note over User,Milvus: Flow 3: AutoRAG Optimization Pipeline
    User->>Dashboard: Select AutoRAG pipeline
    Dashboard->>KFPAPI: Submit pipeline run
    KFPAPI->>S3: GET test data & documents<br/>Auth: AWS creds
    Note right of KFPAPI: test_data_loader, documents_discovery
    KFPAPI->>KFPAPI: Text extraction via Docling (local models)
    KFPAPI->>OGX: POST search space prep<br/>Auth: API key
    KFPAPI->>OGX: POST RAG template optimization<br/>Auth: API key
    OGX-->>KFPAPI: Optimized RAG configuration

    Note over User,Milvus: Flow 4: RAG Multi-Step Pipeline (PDF Processing)
    User->>Dashboard: Select RAG pipeline
    Dashboard->>KFPAPI: Submit pipeline run
    KFPAPI->>Ray: POST RayJob (parse_and_chunk)<br/>Auth: SA Token
    Ray->>S3: Write chunk JSONL<br/>Auth: AWS creds (9000/TCP)
    KFPAPI->>S3: GET chunks<br/>Auth: AWS creds
    KFPAPI->>Milvus: gRPC insert vectors<br/>Auth: Token (optional)
    KFPAPI->>HF: GET embedding model<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
    KFPAPI->>KServe: POST InferenceService<br/>(vLLM + embedding)
